      "text": "ROW_NUMBER() OVER (PARTITION BY x.PERS_ID\n                   ORDER BY x.date_depart, x.motif) AS rn\n…\nWHERE rn = 1                       -- la 02 du 01/02, pas la 34 du 01/11",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 8,
